        "TileImage": "$($repository b13314ab-ea25-48b7-9e51-8ebb87788e20).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47,\rThis mission is personal. Your primary target is Amos Dexter, brother of previous target, Blake Dexter. He&apos;s been plotting a plan in order to finally kill you to avenge his brother&apos;s death. The plan involves Jason Portman, an ally of Amos, to reconstruct his face to look just like you. Because of his involvement he must also be killed.\r\rYou must leave no evidence of you being there at all. Doing so may anger the rest of the Dexter family &amp; attack the ICA directly.\rGood luck.",
